{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04W2", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{descent-section-equivalence}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:dfc84f33609bdbc2c708d99d7affc37d1b5b650463905f8212853b95d80b12f3", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis section is the analogue of\nDescent, Section <REF_0001>\nfor algebraic spaces.\nIt makes sense to read that section first.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:08b2e2c1a4ae015e94f45930f1d77a6002e01e280e68af878932b391db920c2e", "unit_id": "tag:04W2:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "04W2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\{f_i : X_i \\to X\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\mathcal{F}_i, \\varphi_{ij})$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}_i$", "MATH_0007": "$X_i$", "MATH_0008": "$i \\in I$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X_i \\times_X X_j}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\varphi_{ij} : \\text{pr}_0^*\\mathcal{F}_i \\to \\text{pr}_1^*\\mathcal{F}_j$", "MATH_0011": "$(i, j) \\in I^2$", "MATH_0012": "$(i, j, k) \\in I^3$", "MATH_0013": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\text{pr}_0^*\\mathcal{F}_i \\ar[rd]_{\\text{pr}_{01}^*\\varphi_{ij}}\n\\ar[rr]_{\\text{pr}_{02}^*\\varphi_{ik}} & &\n\\text{pr}_2^*\\mathcal{F}_k \\\\\n& \\text{pr}_1^*\\mathcal{F}_j \\ar[ru]_{\\text{pr}_{12}^*\\varphi_{jk}} &\n}\n$$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X_i \\times_X X_j \\times_X X_k}$", "MATH_0015": "$\\psi : (\\mathcal{F}_i, \\varphi_{ij}) \\to\n(\\mathcal{F}'_i, \\varphi'_{ij})$", "MATH_0016": "$\\psi = (\\psi_i)_{i\\in I}$", "MATH_0017": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X_i}$", "MATH_0018": "$\\psi_i : \\mathcal{F}_i \\to \\mathcal{F}'_i$", "MATH_0019": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\text{pr}_0^*\\mathcal{F}_i \\ar[r]_{\\varphi_{ij}} \\ar[d]_{\\text{pr}_0^*\\psi_i}\n& \\text{pr}_1^*\\mathcal{F}_j \\ar[d]^{\\text{pr}_1^*\\psi_j} \\\\\n\\text{pr}_0^*\\mathcal{F}'_i \\ar[r]^{\\varphi'_{ij}} &\n\\text{pr}_1^*\\mathcal{F}'_j \\\\\n}\n$$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-descent-datum-quasi-coherent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7758bea8c1058e5e1a3b233e1c02d78848762dba5e9f611502d353c3e35b7824", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cf2a0d88bd7bdbb701f7dbe657dff8143b52cd912500217226dc19184ca1a563", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a family\nof morphisms of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003> with fixed target <MATH_0004>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>descent datum <MATH_0005>\nfor quasi-coherent sheaves<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> with respect to the given family\nis given by a quasi-coherent sheaf <MATH_0006> on <MATH_0007> for\neach <MATH_0008>, an isomorphism of quasi-coherent\n<MATH_0009>-modules\n<MATH_0010>\nfor each pair <MATH_0011>\nsuch that for every triple of indices <MATH_0012> the\ndiagram\n<MATH_0013>\nof <MATH_0014>-modules\ncommutes. This is called the <TEXTITOPEN_0002>cocycle condition<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0003> A <TEXTITOPEN_0003>morphism <MATH_0015> of descent data<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> is given\nby a family <MATH_0016> of morphisms of\n<MATH_0017>-modules <MATH_0018>\nsuch that all the diagrams\n<MATH_0019>\ncommute.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f8256c51adc2188d2445552dc1aceb350c4606f06711a7a0af5c736f34234150", "unit_id": "tag:04W3:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04W2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{U} = \\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{V} = \\{V_j \\to V\\}_{j \\in J}$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$(g, \\alpha : I \\to J, (g_i)) : \\mathcal{U} \\to \\mathcal{V}$", "MATH_0006": "$(\\mathcal{F}_j, \\varphi_{jj'})$", "MATH_0007": "$\\{V_j \\to V\\}_{j \\in J}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\left(g_i^*\\mathcal{F}_{\\alpha(i)},\n(g_i \\times g_{i'})^*\\varphi_{\\alpha(i)\\alpha(i')}\\right)\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0010": "$(\\mathcal{F}_j, \\varphi_{jj'})$", "MATH_0011": "$(g', \\alpha' : I \\to J, (g'_i))$", "MATH_0012": "$g = g'$", "MATH_0013": "$$\n(g_i^*\\mathcal{F}_{\\alpha(i)},\n(g_i \\times g_{i'})^*\\varphi_{\\alpha(i)\\alpha(i')})\n\\cong\n((g'_i)^*\\mathcal{F}_{\\alpha'(i)},\n(g'_i \\times g'_{i'})^*\\varphi_{\\alpha'(i)\\alpha'(i')}).\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-definition-morphism-coverings}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-map-families}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b85a573fe6bc13b1e1f2fa413a713dcac11e4532fed88df8f1b14e78ad3395b8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f68cbaee1094aa2fd6c8d280d411bbafcd59d86c1e6252ddf153f2ff2599f6e2", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> and\n<MATH_0003>\nbe families of morphisms of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0004> with fixed targets.\nLet <MATH_0005>\nbe a morphism of families of maps with fixed target, see\nSites, Definition <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0006> be a descent\ndatum for quasi-coherent sheaves with respect to the\nfamily <MATH_0007>. Then\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The system\n<MATH_0008>\nis a descent datum with respect to the family <MATH_0009>.\n<STRUCT_0003> This construction is functorial in the descent datum\n<MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0004> Given a second morphism\n<MATH_0011>\nof families of maps with fixed target\nwith <MATH_0012> there exists a functorial isomorphism of descent data\n<MATH_0013>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b8d046c064475b8ed481c523ba9ff4b15dd752e120052d0cb5c41052ee3fa81a", "unit_id": "tag:04W4:statement"}
